      "source": "A factory that can generate byte code to speed-up dynamic property access. Uses the <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>'s\n<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> to discover the access to properties. Properties are accessed either using method handles\nto overcome Java visibility issues or directly using field access/getter/setter calls.",
      "translation": "一个能够生成字节码以加速动态属性访问的工厂。它利用 <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 中的 <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 来发现属性的访问方式。属性访问要么通过方法句柄（MethodHandle）来解决 Java 可见性问题，要么直接使用字段访问或 getter/setter 调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
